{
  "_note": "多城市卡取数:「我的城市」前 5 座,**一次多坐标请求**拿全。\n⚠️ 这条流**不缓存**(§5.5:组件卡的 .df 恒不缓存)—— 卡片的新鲜度由宿主的 refresh 周期管。\n由 tools/infosource/gen_weather_cities.py 生成。",
  "version": 1,
  "i18n": {
    "zh-CN": {
      "autoCn": "上海",
      "autoUs": "纽约"
    },
    "en-US": {
      "autoCn": "Shanghai",
      "autoUs": "New York"
    }
  },
  "actions": [
    {
      "_note": "「我的城市」—— 这张卡不吃实例参数,整份列表就是它的数据源。",
      "id": "saved",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "cities",
        "default": []
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "读取屏障(勿删):data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_bs",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_n0",
        "value": "$[length::(${saved})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "国内默认判据(doc/overseas-first.md §1,逐字照抄):地区 cn,或地区未知且界面中文 → 1。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cnd",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${@app.region},cn),1,if::(eq::(${@app.region},overseas),0,if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "2026-10-08:「我的城市」为空(新用户)时退回默认城市一行(国内上海 / 海外纽约,与单城市卡的 auto 同一套),\n渲染层给这一行标「默认」并在底部写一句现状 —— 此前整张 44 只有一行灰字,大片空白。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dflt",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${_n0},0),0,1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_dn",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${cnd},1),findNotEmpty::(${@i18n.autoCn},Shanghai),findNotEmpty::(${@i18n.autoUs},New York))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_dla",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${cnd},1),31.2222,40.7128)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_dlo",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${cnd},1),121.4581,-74.0060)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${dflt}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "saved",
            "value": [
              {
                "name": "${_dn}",
                "lat": "${_dla}",
                "lon": "${_dlo}"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_note": "`n` 是渲染层的行数守卫 —— 卡上画几行由它定(列表为空时已换成默认城市,n=1)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "n",
        "value": "$[length::(${saved})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "wxenv.unit_acts:温度单位设置 `data.wxUnit` = c / f(doc/overseas-first.md §7)。管理页「我的城市」里切换;没设过 → 按系统地区(@app.country)缺省。",
      "id": "_wxu",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "wxUnit",
        "default": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "读取屏障(勿删):data.get 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_bu",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "缺省按国家:US / LR / MM / BS / BZ / KY / PW / FM / MH → f(华氏),其余(含 country 为空 = 未知)→ c。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "unit",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_wxu},f),f,if::(eq::(${_wxu},c),c,if::(or::(eq::(${@app.country},US),or::(eq::(${@app.country},LR),or::(eq::(${@app.country},MM),or::(eq::(${@app.country},BS),or::(eq::(${@app.country},BZ),or::(eq::(${@app.country},KY),or::(eq::(${@app.country},PW),or::(eq::(${@app.country},FM),eq::(${@app.country},MH))))))))),f,c)))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "拼到 Open-Meteo URL 末尾;摄氏时为空,URL 与此前逐字相同。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "uq",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${unit},f),&temperature_unit=fahrenheit&wind_speed_unit=mph,)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "风速单位文案(渲染层拼在「风速」后面)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wu",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${unit},f),mph,km/h)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "行几何三档:5 座 62 / 4 座 76 / ≤3 座 100(pt)。之前恒 62 → 3 座只占上半张卡,下半张一片空。\n所有纵向坐标与字号都在这里算完,RCN 只吃 `${裸变量}pt`(坐标字段里写算术/方法 = 静默失效)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_rh",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${n},5),62,if::(eq::(${n},4),76,100))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "剩余高度均分成 n+1 段间隙 → 行块在行区内均匀铺开(1 座居中、2 座三等分…)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_sp",
        "value": "$[calc::((306-${n}*${_rh})/(${n}+1))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "5 座那档 5×62 略超 306 → 间隙钳 0(行卡 54 高,最后一行底 340 < 354 不溢出)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_g",
        "value": "$[if::(lt::(${_sp},0),0,floor::(${_sp}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "行卡高 = 行距 − 8pt 行间隙。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "rb",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_rh},62),54,if::(eq::(${_rh},76),68,92))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_no",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_rh},62),8,if::(eq::(${_rh},76),12,20))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_co",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_rh},62),30,if::(eq::(${_rh},76),37,50))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_to",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_rh},62),3,if::(eq::(${_rh},76),8,15))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_ho",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_rh},62),33,if::(eq::(${_rh},76),42,60))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nf",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_rh},62),15,if::(eq::(${_rh},76),16,17))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cf",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_rh},62),11.5,if::(eq::(${_rh},76),12,13))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tf",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_rh},62),24,if::(eq::(${_rh},76),28,34))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hf",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_rh},62),10.5,if::(eq::(${_rh},76),11,12))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "天况图标:与天况文字同一行、在文字左边。`_io` = 图标顶相对行卡顶的偏移,`isz` = 图标边长,\n`cx` = 天况文字让出图标后的 x。三档随字号一起走,图标竖向中心对齐文字 ink 中心\n(txt 盒顶 = 字形 ink 顶,中心 ≈ 盒顶 + 0.42×字号)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_io",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_rh},62),27,if::(eq::(${_rh},76),33.5,46.5))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "isz",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_rh},62),16,if::(eq::(${_rh},76),17,18))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cx",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_rh},62),45,if::(eq::(${_rh},76),46,47))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "第 i 行行卡顶 y = Y0 + g + i×(rh + g)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ry0",
        "value": "$[calc::(38+${_g}+0*(${_rh}+${_g}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ny0",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry0}+${_no})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cy0",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry0}+${_co})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ty0",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry0}+${_to})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hy0",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry0}+${_ho})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "iy0",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry0}+${_io})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ry1",
        "value": "$[calc::(38+${_g}+1*(${_rh}+${_g}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ny1",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry1}+${_no})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cy1",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry1}+${_co})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ty1",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry1}+${_to})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hy1",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry1}+${_ho})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "iy1",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry1}+${_io})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ry2",
        "value": "$[calc::(38+${_g}+2*(${_rh}+${_g}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ny2",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry2}+${_no})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cy2",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry2}+${_co})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ty2",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry2}+${_to})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hy2",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry2}+${_ho})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "iy2",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry2}+${_io})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ry3",
        "value": "$[calc::(38+${_g}+3*(${_rh}+${_g}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ny3",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry3}+${_no})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cy3",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry3}+${_co})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ty3",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry3}+${_to})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hy3",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry3}+${_ho})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "iy3",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry3}+${_io})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ry4",
        "value": "$[calc::(38+${_g}+4*(${_rh}+${_g}))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ny4",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry4}+${_no})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cy4",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry4}+${_co})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ty4",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry4}+${_to})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hy4",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry4}+${_ho})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "iy4",
        "value": "$[calc::(${ry4}+${_io})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "⚠️ 字面下标 —— VParser 的方括号寻址只认字面数字,`${saved[${i}]}` 会静默求空。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c0",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c1",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c2",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},2)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c3",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},3)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "c4",
        "value": "$[index::(${saved},4)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "⚠️ 坐标必须**逐槽兜底**,空槽回落到第一座城市(第一座也没有就落 0)——\n多坐标 URL 里出现空段(`latitude=31.2,,,,`)会让 Open-Meteo 返 400,\n而一个 400 会让整条流失败:连有城市的那几行也一起没了。\n回落只是让同一个坐标在**同一次请求**里重复出现,不额外往返、也不会被限流\n(这正是从「5 路并发 + 回落」换成「一次多坐标」的收益之一)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_la0",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c0.lat},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_lo0",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c0.lon},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm0",
        "value": "${c0.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "la0",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c0.lat},${_la0})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lo0",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c0.lon},${_lo0})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm1",
        "value": "${c1.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "la1",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c1.lat},${_la0})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lo1",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c1.lon},${_lo0})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm2",
        "value": "${c2.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "la2",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c2.lat},${_la0})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lo2",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c2.lon},${_lo0})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm3",
        "value": "${c3.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "la3",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c3.lat},${_la0})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lo3",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c3.lon},${_lo0})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nm4",
        "value": "${c4.name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "la4",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c4.lat},${_la0})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lo4",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c4.lon},${_lo0})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "⚠️ n=1 那一档把同一个坐标写两遍 —— Open-Meteo 只在多坐标时返回数组,单坐标返回对象。\n不这么做,「只有一座城市」就成了一条几乎没人走、也没人测的取值分叉。\n重复坐标对服务端近乎零成本(实测 generationtime 亚毫秒)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "u1",
        "value": "https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?current=temperature_2m,weather_code,is_day&daily=temperature_2m_max,temperature_2m_min&forecast_days=1&timezone=auto&latitude=${la0},${la0}&longitude=${lo0},${lo0}${uq}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "u2",
        "value": "https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?current=temperature_2m,weather_code,is_day&daily=temperature_2m_max,temperature_2m_min&forecast_days=1&timezone=auto&latitude=${la0},${la1}&longitude=${lo0},${lo1}${uq}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "u3",
        "value": "https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?current=temperature_2m,weather_code,is_day&daily=temperature_2m_max,temperature_2m_min&forecast_days=1&timezone=auto&latitude=${la0},${la1},${la2}&longitude=${lo0},${lo1},${lo2}${uq}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "u4",
        "value": "https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?current=temperature_2m,weather_code,is_day&daily=temperature_2m_max,temperature_2m_min&forecast_days=1&timezone=auto&latitude=${la0},${la1},${la2},${la3}&longitude=${lo0},${lo1},${lo2},${lo3}${uq}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "u5",
        "value": "https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?current=temperature_2m,weather_code,is_day&daily=temperature_2m_max,temperature_2m_min&forecast_days=1&timezone=auto&latitude=${la0},${la1},${la2},${la3},${la4}&longitude=${lo0},${lo1},${lo2},${lo3},${lo4}${uq}"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "按城市数选那一条拼好的 URL。**只有一个 request** —— 分档发生在拼串上,不在请求上。\n⚠️ 嵌套方法只在最外层包一次方法括号,内层直接写方法名:DSL 不允许嵌套的方法起始符,\n   多写一层会原样拼进 URL。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "url",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${n},1),${u1},if::(eq::(${n},2),${u2},if::(eq::(${n},3),${u3},if::(eq::(${n},4),${u4},${u5}))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "一次请求拿全部城市。响应是**数组**,逐项 `$[index::(${resp},k)]` 取(字面下标)。\n⚠️ `formatType: \"json\"` 不能漏 —— 漏了响应不解析,下面每一个取值都静默变空。",
      "id": "resp",
      "action": "request",
      "params": {
        "url": "${url}",
        "method": "GET",
        "formatType": "json"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "读取屏障(勿删):request 之后紧邻的节点读不到结果。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_barrier",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_x0",
        "value": "$[index::(${resp},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "⚠️ 取不到就**留空**,不要落 0 —— `eq::` 是数字化比较,空串与 0 无从区分,\n于是「没取到」会被渲成一个理直气壮的 `0°`。空值让渲染层自己走 `--`。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tp0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_x0.current.temperature_2m},__none__),__none__),,parseNumber::(${_x0.current.temperature_2m},0))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "当日最高/最低(`daily[0]`,URL 带 `timezone=auto` + `forecast_days=1` → 就是该城本地的今天)。\n取不到同样**留空**不落 0,理由同 tp。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_hm0",
        "value": "$[index::(${_x0.daily.temperature_2m_max},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_hn0",
        "value": "$[index::(${_x0.daily.temperature_2m_min},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hi0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_hm0},__none__),__none__),,parseNumber::(${_hm0},0))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "lo0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_hn0},__none__),__none__),,parseNumber::(${_hn0},0))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_cd0",
        "value": "${_x0.current.weather_code}"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "`is_day` 由服务端按**该城市自己的时区**给(URL 带 `timezone=auto`)——\n不能拿本机时间去判:这张卡的卖点正是「几座城市一起看」,跨时区是常态。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_nt0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_x0.current.is_day},0),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "gp0",
        "value": "$[if::(le::(${_cd0},0),clear,if::(le::(${_cd0},2),partly,if::(le::(${_cd0},3),cloudy,if::(le::(${_cd0},48),fog,if::(le::(${_cd0},57),drizzle,if::(le::(${_cd0},67),rain,if::(le::(${_cd0},77),snow,if::(le::(${_cd0},82),rain,if::(le::(${_cd0},86),snow,thunder)))))))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "sk0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_nt0},1),night,if::(or::(eq::(${gp0},clear),eq::(${gp0},partly)),clear,if::(eq::(${gp0},snow),snow,if::(or::(eq::(${gp0},cloudy),eq::(${gp0},fog)),overcast,rain))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "图标键 = 天况组,夜里的晴 / 多云换成月亮变体 —— 与 weather.df 的 `iconKey` 逐字同式。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ic0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${_nt0},1),if::(eq::(${gp0},clear),clear_night,if::(eq::(${gp0},partly),partly_night,${gp0})),${gp0})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_x1",
        "value": "$[index::(${resp},1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tp1",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${_x1.current.temperature_2m},__none__),__none__),,parseNumber::(${_x1.current.temperature_2m},0))]"
